{"4599540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Antarctic Showdown", "steam_appid": 4599540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kill Your Friend!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since ancient times, when conflict arose between penguin tribes, each side would send forth their champion warrior to settle matters in one-on-one combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a tradition has since become a beloved spectacle that all penguins go wild for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For glory. For survival. To kill your friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike down your opponent and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599540/extras/1dfc34794d0374e859c1d7bd55074887.poster.avif?t=1785994387\" width=742 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599540/extras/1dfc34794d0374e859c1d7bd55074887.webm?t=1785994387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599540/extras/1dfc34794d0374e859c1d7bd55074887.mp4?t=1785994387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat Fuels Your Strength</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be too discouraged by a loss. Every defeat is a lesson on the path to victory, so grow stronger through upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 100 upgrades and find your own way to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599540/extras/dd244f3c475946fc795eb02067a5fff7.poster.avif?t=1785994